    <h2>3. Methodology</h2>
    <p>The research will utilize a three-phase approach:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Phase I: Data Collection:</strong> Utilizing IoT sensors in pilot neighborhoods to track mobility patterns and common barriers.</li>
