    </ul>

    <h2>4. Expected Impact</h2>
    <p>
        The successful implementation of Project Horizon will provide a blueprint for "Inclusive Urbanism." By treating accessibility not as a set of static ramps, but as a dynamic, technology-enabled ecosystem, we can significantly reduce social isolation and increase the economic participation of individuals with disabilities.
